  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 408.16 Hearing and Appeal. Prior to denying or revoking a certificate issued under this part, a certificate holder shall be provided with written notice of the commissioner’s allegations and provided an opportunity for a hearing in accordance with Lab 200.\n\nSource. #7142, eff 11-24-99, EXPIRED: 11-24-07\n\nNew. #9878-A eff 2-25-11, EXPIRED: 2-25-19\n\nNew. #12815, eff 6-26-19",
